gearcoleco (1.0.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * All platforms:
  * Full Colecovision catalog compatibility.
  * Accurate Z80 emulation.
  * Accurate TMS9918 video emulation.
  * Save states.
  * Windows , Linux and Mac (desktop):
  * Full debugger.
  * Portable mode.
  * Gamepad controllers.
  * Scanlines and ghosting.
  * Custom palettes.
  * RetroArch (libretro):
  * Windows, Linux, macOS, Raspberry Pi, Android, iOS, tvOS, PlayStation
    Vita, PlayStation 3, Nintendo 3DS, Nintendo GameCube, Nintendo Wii,
    Nintendo WiiU, Nintendo Switch, Emscripten, Classic Mini systems
    (NES, SNES, C64, ...), OpenDingux and QNX.
  * Soft Patching
  * Achievements
  * Rewind

